From 39d869ed59a071d7999324f67bcfc24e3fdd5165 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:29:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Boss teams: story bosses keep their threats without the
 hardest combos

Lance leads with Aerodactyl (Crunch for Curse) and brings his Gyarados
fourth with a Sitrus Berry. Karen's Tyranitar has Ice Punch for Dragon
Dance and her Weavile a Razor Claw for the Focus Sash. Clair's Gyarados
and Kingdra get their own sets, and her Gabite loses Swords Dance. Koga's
Ariados holds Black Sludge, Ariana's Radio Tower Honchkrow a Sharp Beak,
and Pryce's Jynx has Fake Out for Lovely Kiss. Proton in the Slowpoke
Well and Petrel in the Radio Tower get a little stronger. The post-game
teams keep the full combos.
